<section class="section section--white" aria-labelledby="s1-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="split__aside">
        <h2 class="split__title rv" id="s1-title">AI Security Services for Applications, LLMs and AI Agents</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="split__body prose">
        <p class="rv">AI security services help organizations identify and address vulnerabilities in AI-powered applications and large language models (LLMs) along with AI agents and connected systems. These services include security assessments and vulnerability testing to reduce risks involving data exposure and unauthorized access.</p>
        <p class="rv">As businesses adopt generative AI and autonomous AI agents, securing models alone is no longer sufficient. AI agents interact with APIs and enterprise data while executing tasks and making decisions based on user instructions. Weak access controls and excessive permissions can expose sensitive information or allow agents to perform unauthorized actions. CipherTrivia provides AI security services to identify vulnerabilities across AI applications and LLM-based systems as well as agentic AI workflows.</p>
        <p class="rv">Our AI security assessments evaluate risks such as prompt injection and sensitive data exposure along with insecure tool integrations and excessive AI agent permissions. We assess how AI agents access resources and process instructions while interacting with connected systems to identify potential attack paths and security gaps. Our findings and remediation recommendations help organizations strengthen AI application security and adopt AI agents with greater control over data access and automated actions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="figure-wide rv">
      <div class="aimap" data-aimap>
        <div class="aimap__board" data-aimap-board role="img" aria-label="Map of an AI application and the security risks tested at each point. User prompts: prompt injection. AI application: broken access controls. LLM: model abuse and manipulation, sensitive data exposure. AI agent: excessive AI agent permissions. APIs and external tools: insecure API integrations. Enterprise documents: indirect prompt injection. RAG retrieval: RAG data exposure. Connected systems: insecure output handling.">
          <canvas class="aimap__canvas"></canvas>
          <p class="aimap__key">AI-specific risks</p>
          <ol class="aimap__nodes">
            {%- for n in aimap %}
            <li class="aimap__node{% if n[3] %} aimap__node--ai{% endif %}" data-aimap-node="{{ n[0] }}">
              {{ icon(n[1], "sm") }}
              <p class="aimap__name">{{ n[2] }}</p>
              <ul class="aimap__risks">
                {%- for r in n[4] %}
                <li class="aimap__risk">{{ r }}</li>
                {%- endfor %}
              </ul>
            </li>
            {%- endfor %}
          </ol>
        </div>
        <button class="board__toggle" type="button" aria-label="Pause animation" data-aimap-toggle>
          <svg class="board__i-pause" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3v10M11 3v10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg>
          <svg class="board__i-play" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3l8 5-8 5z" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

