<section class="section section--white" aria-labelledby="s4-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="process process--light">
      <div class="process__aside">
        <h2 class="process__title" id="s4-title">Our AI Security Testing Process</h2>
        <p class="process__lede">CipherTrivia follows a structured AI security testing process to identify vulnerabilities across AI applications and LLM-based systems along with autonomous AI agents. Our approach combines security reviews with controlled testing to uncover potential attack paths and provide actionable recommendations.</p>
      </div>

      <ol class="process__list" data-process>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Scope Definition and AI Architecture Review</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We identify the AI models and applications within scope while reviewing system architecture and data flows along with connected APIs and agent integrations. This helps establish the testing objectives and identify critical security boundaries.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">AI Threat Analysis</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We analyze potential attack scenarios involving prompt injection and sensitive data exposure along with insecure tool access and excessive AI agent permissions. This step helps prioritize the components and workflows that require focused security testing.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">AI Security Testing and Attack Simulation</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We conduct authorized security tests against relevant AI components to identify vulnerabilities in prompts and model responses as well as API integrations and agent workflows. Testing may include attempts to bypass security restrictions or trigger unauthorized tool execution.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Vulnerability Validation and Risk Assessment</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We validate identified weaknesses and evaluate their potential impact on application security and business data. Findings are prioritized based on severity and exploitability so organizations can focus on the most significant risks.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Reporting and Remediation Guidance</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We deliver a detailed AI security assessment report covering identified vulnerabilities and supporting evidence along with risk ratings and practical remediation recommendations. Retesting can be performed when included in the agreed scope to validate implemented fixes.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

