<section class="section section--stone" aria-labelledby="s6-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta"></div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s6-title">Common AI Security Risks We Identify</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">AI systems introduce security risks that differ from those found in traditional applications. Our AI security assessments focus on identifying weaknesses that could affect data confidentiality and application integrity or allow unauthorized system actions.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <ul class="includes includes--4">
      <li class="include rv">{{ icon("syringe", "sm") }}<p><strong>Prompt Injection:</strong> Malicious instructions can manipulate an AI system into ignoring intended restrictions or disclosing protected information.</p></li>
      <li class="include rv" style="--d:1">{{ icon("unlock", "sm") }}<p><strong>Sensitive Data Exposure:</strong> Inadequate safeguards can expose confidential information through prompts and model responses or connected data sources.</p></li>
      <li class="include rv" style="--d:2">{{ icon("terminal", "sm") }}<p><strong>Insecure Output Handling:</strong> Unvalidated AI-generated content can introduce security risks when applications process or execute the output.</p></li>
      <li class="include rv" style="--d:3">{{ icon("shield-crack", "sm") }}<p><strong>Broken Access Controls:</strong> Weak authorization mechanisms can allow users or AI agents to access resources beyond their assigned permissions.</p></li>
      <li class="include rv">{{ icon("directory", "sm") }}<p><strong>RAG Data Exposure:</strong> Improper retrieval permissions can expose documents or records that a user should not be able to access.</p></li>
      <li class="include rv" style="--d:1">{{ icon("escalate", "sm") }}<p><strong>Excessive AI Agent Permissions:</strong> Overprivileged agents may invoke tools or perform actions beyond their intended scope.</p></li>
      <li class="include rv" style="--d:2">{{ icon("link", "sm") }}<p><strong>Insecure API Integrations:</strong> Weak authentication and insufficient validation across connected services can expose AI application components to attacks.</p></li>
      <li class="include rv" style="--d:3">{{ icon("alert", "sm") }}<p><strong>Model Abuse and Manipulation:</strong> Adversarial inputs can exploit weaknesses in model behavior and undermine intended security restrictions.</p></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

